* CABSRT03 - SORT FOR THE USAGE TYPE SPLIT
* MVT SORT/MERGE CONTROL CARD.  SORTS TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.DATEVAL
* BY OCN/BAN/CIRCUIT/USOC SO CABING05 CAN SPLIT VOICE, DATA AND
* SPECIAL WITHOUT A GROUP BREAK IN THE MIDDLE OF A CIRCUIT'S
* RECORDS.
*
* THE SUMMARISATION HAS LEFT THIS CARD.  DUPLICATE
* OCN/BAN/CIRCUIT/USOC KEYS ARE COLLAPSED INTO ONE RECORD, AND
* THEIR PACKED CONVERSATION MINUTES AT COLUMN 120 FOR SEVEN
* BYTES ADDED, BY THE E35 EXIT CABSXMIN.  THIS REMAINS THE
* ESTATE'S ONLY DEDUPLICATION-BY-SUMMING RULE - CABING03 CATCHES
* EXACT DUPLICATE SEQUENCE NUMBERS ONLY, NOT TWO DIFFERENT CDRS
* FOR THE SAME USAGE WINDOW.  NO CABING PROGRAM IS TOLD THAT THE
* COLLAPSE HAPPENED.
*
* EQUAL KEY HANDLING IS NOT CODED.  DUPLICATE KEYS ARE EXPECTED
* ON THIS SORT, AND CABSXMIN NOW DECIDES WHICH IMAGE SURVIVES A
* GROUP - IT KEEPS THE FIRST RECORD OF THE GROUP AND ACCUMULATES
* INTO IT IN THE ORDER THE MERGE PRESENTS THE RECORDS.
*
* THE SUMMARISATION RULE IS NO LONGER READABLE FROM THIS CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(5,4,CH,A,9,13,CH,A,60,10,CH,A,70,5,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(200)
 MODS E35=(CABSXMIN,8192,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
